      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Latency detail: discovery = ~2851 input tokens, 700–1000 output tokens, 3.5–5.2s; word_lookup ≈ 0.5s.\nWordContent is global per word + native language + model + prompt version. Cached words skip the discovery agent.\nDiscovery responses now return cached-only audio. /words/lookup still synthesizes US/UK synchronously (planned: cached-only + lazy play).",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
